        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Leveraging our DARPin platform, we have designed product candidates with MoAs that we believe have the potential to offer therapeutic options to patients with higher efficacy and fewer adverse events compared to the current standard of care.",
